### Scenario 33 — Claim closed without penalty (CLOSED_NO_PENALTY)
### IntelliJ HTTP Client syntax.
### Originally tested an attachment saga, but /api/attachments/** is not proxied
### through the auth-service edge — it would require hitting claim-service directly.
### Replaced with the no-penalty close flow which exercises the same support-decision branch.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@blps.local
@adminPass = adminpass
@landlordEmail = landlord@blps.local
@landlordPass = landpass
@tenantEmail = tenant@blps.local
@tenantPass = tenantpass

### 33.1 Resolve tenant id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Basic {{tenantEmail}} {{tenantPass}}

> {%
client.global.set("tenant33_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 33.2 Landlord creates low-amount claim
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims
Authorization: Basic {{landlordEmail}} {{landlordPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": {{tenant33_id}},
  "title": "No-damage claim",
  "description": "Tenant returned unit in good condition.",
  "claimedAmount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

> {%
client.global.set("claim33_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 33.3 Admin: intake-start
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}/intake-start
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}

### 33.4 Admin: intake-decision (no extra info)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}/intake-decision
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestAdditionalInfo": false, "note": "" }

### 33.5 Admin: assessment with no grounds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}/assessment
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "penaltyGrounds": false, "assessmentAmount": 0, "assessmentNotes": "No damage observed." }

### 33.6 Tenant: short ack
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}/tenant-response
Authorization: Basic {{tenantEmail}} {{tenantPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Thanks, all good." }

### 33.7 Support closes without penalty
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}/support-decision
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applyPenalty": false,
  "penaltyAmount": 0,
  "penaltyCurrency": "USD",
  "simulateFailure": false,
  "resolutionNote": "Closed without penalty."
}

### 33.8 Verify CLOSED_NO_PENALTY
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{landlordEmail}} {{landlordPass}}

### 33.9 History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claim33_id}}/history
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPass}}
